%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif", "fontSize": "15px", "actorBkg": "#E0F4F4", "actorBorder": "#01A88D", "actorTextColor": "#06433A", "signalColor": "#232F3E", "signalTextColor": "#232F3E", "noteBkgColor": "#FFF4E5", "noteBorderColor": "#FF9900", "activationBkgColor": "#FFE8D1", "activationBorderColor": "#ED7100", "sequenceNumberColor": "#ffffff"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as 👨‍💻 Developer
    participant GH as 🐙 GitHub Actions
    participant ECR as 📦 ECR
    participant SSM as 🛰️ SSM Run Command
    participant EC2 as 🖥️ EC2 server
    participant RDS as 🗄️ RDS MySQL
    participant CF as ⚡ CloudFront

    Dev->>GH: git push to main
    rect rgb(232, 245, 214)
        Note over GH: TEST job
        GH->>GH: unit tests · MySQL 8.4 migrations (fresh + re-run) · start app, check /healthz
    end
    rect rgb(224, 244, 244)
        Note over GH,ECR: BUILD job (signs in with OIDC, no stored keys)
        GH->>ECR: docker build + push artistikcity:<commit-sha>
    end
    rect rgb(255, 232, 209)
        Note over GH,EC2: DEPLOY job
        GH->>SSM: send-command deploy-image.sh <image>
        SSM->>EC2: run deploy script as root
        activate EC2
        EC2->>ECR: docker pull image
        EC2->>EC2: settings from Secrets Manager + Parameter Store
        EC2->>RDS: run pending database migrations
        alt migration fails
            EC2-->>SSM: stop · live site untouched
        else migrations OK
            EC2->>EC2: replace container · wait for /healthz
            alt healthy within 3 min
                EC2-->>SSM: success · new version live
            else not healthy
                EC2->>EC2: start the previous image again (automatic rollback)
                EC2-->>SSM: failed · previous version live
            end
        end
        deactivate EC2
        SSM-->>GH: result + server log
        GH->>CF: invalidate /assets/* /fonts/*
        GH->>CF: GET https://www.artistikcity.com/healthz
        CF-->>GH: 200 {"status":"UP"}
    end
    GH-->>Dev: ✅ deployed (or ❌ with the reason)
